From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Toxpox <toxpox@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 11:45:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: ti: build T3 Gemstone O1 DTB

The board DTS is not upstream yet, so Armbian carries the whole file in
patch/kernel/archive/k3-6.18/dt/ and copies it in through dts-directories.
Copying alone never builds it - the Makefile entry below is what makes the
DTB appear.

Signed-off-by: Toxpox <toxpox@outlook.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/ti/Makefile | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/ti/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/ti/Makefile
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/ti/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/ti/Makefile
@@ -139,3 +139,4 @@
 # Boards with J722s SoC
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-am67a-beagley-ai.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-am67a-t3-gem-o1.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-j722s-evm.dtb
--
Armbian
